{"3589150": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Scientist Simulator", "steam_appid": 3589150, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is a scientist simulation game where researchers working in microbiology, biochemistry, immunology, and virology laboratories strive to find cures for viruses, parasites, bacteria, and infectious diseases. Alongside you, the game also features microbiologists, biochemists, immunologists, virologists, and doctors.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this simulation game, you must take the necessary steps to identify diseases and develop vaccines for their treatment. Don’t forget to discuss your findings with microbiologists, biochemists, doctors, and immunology and virology experts in your laboratory to refine your skills.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After conducting various laboratory tests, diagnose diseases and prepare them for vaccine production. The new treatments and vaccines you discover will make you wealthy and advance medical science.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >MAIN FEATURES:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the microbiology, biochemistry, and immunology lab, examine blood samples under microscopes and identify them. Determine disease diagnoses based on the data you obtain. Watch simulations during the game to diagnose diseases and develop new vaccines for treatments. Work with microbiologists, biochemists, doctors, virology, immunology, and medical oncology specialists to diagnose viruses, parasites, bacteria, and cancers.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3589150/extras/6494ab11bbcd1e37be53d427714c5976.avif?t=1762416298\" alt=\"Blood cells and viruses\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3589150/extras_big/6494ab11bbcd1e37be53d427714c5976.avif?t=1762416298 width=1560 height=1212 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Test your vaccines on hamsters and analyze the results.When you find the right vaccine, apply for a patent and sell it to pharmaceutical companies to get rich.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3589150/extras/a45135ae468c3bf39ac769b561c4cc8c.avif?t=1762416298\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Conduct new experiments to discover emerging diseases before anyone else, and diagnose deadly viruses and cancers.Analyze various cancer tissues and identify disease stages to help people and save lives.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3589150/extras/ec6e5c262ebcfc804ba51a2609e92b8f.avif?t=1762416298\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Share the images you examine with a microscope with other scientists on computer screens and get their opinions, you will need help when producing a vaccine.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3589150/extras/c8be82531b727a7ab3247657ccde6c3f.avif?t=1762416298\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >To do this, you need to follow the animations that the game shows you carefully and reach the highest level of science, only then can you become a good scientist.Even though your primary goal is to serve humanity, earning a little money never hurt anyone.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is a scientist simulation game where researchers working in microbiology, biochemistry, immunology, and virology laboratories strive to find cures for viruses, parasites, bacteria, and infectious diseases. Alongside you, the game also features microbiologists, biochemists, immunologists, virologists, and doctors.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this simulation game, you must take the necessary steps to identify diseases and develop vaccines for their treatment. Don’t forget to discuss your findings with microbiologists, biochemists, doctors, and immunology and virology experts in your laboratory to refine your skills.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After conducting various laboratory tests, diagnose diseases and prepare them for vaccine production. The new treatments and vaccines you discover will make you wealthy and advance medical science.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >MAIN FEATURES:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the microbiology, biochemistry, and immunology lab, examine blood samples under microscopes and identify them. Determine disease diagnoses based on the data you obtain. Watch simulations during the game to diagnose diseases and develop new vaccines for treatments. Work with microbiologists, biochemists, doctors, virology, immunology, and medical oncology specialists to diagnose viruses, parasites, bacteria, and cancers.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3589150/extras/6494ab11bbcd1e37be53d427714c5976.avif?t=1762416298\" alt=\"Blood cells and viruses\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3589150/extras_big/6494ab11bbcd1e37be53d427714c5976.avif?t=1762416298 width=1560 height=1212 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Test your vaccines on hamsters and analyze the results.When you find the right vaccine, apply for a patent and sell it to pharmaceutical companies to get rich.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3589150/extras/a45135ae468c3bf39ac769b561c4cc8c.avif?t=1762416298\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Conduct new experiments to discover emerging diseases before anyone else, and diagnose deadly viruses and cancers.Analyze various cancer tissues and identify disease stages to help people and save lives.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3589150/extras/ec6e5c262ebcfc804ba51a2609e92b8f.avif?t=1762416298\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Share the images you examine with a microscope with other scientists on computer screens and get their opinions, you will need help when producing a vaccine.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3589150/extras/c8be82531b727a7ab3247657ccde6c3f.avif?t=1762416298\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >To do this, you need to follow the animations that the game shows you carefully and reach the highest level of science, only then can you become a good scientist.Even though your primary goal is to serve humanity, earning a little money never hurt anyone.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "short_description": "Build your own laboratory and find cures for diseases. Eradicate cancer, viruses, bacteria, and parasitic diseases by developing new vaccines and medications. Get rich selling your products. Work with biochemists, microbiologists, doctors, and geneticists.", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong>, French<strong>*</strong>, Italian<strong>*</s